The goal is to establish an information system that enables real-time traffic management and the use of electronic transactions in goods transport, through the following measures: 

Development of intermodal electronic real-time transaction and information systems; 

Harmonization of communication standards, procedures, and transport documents based on EDI; 

Unification of liability regulations with the aim of providing customers with a clear set of transparent liability conditions and procedures for damaged or lost goods; 

Development of information society technologies to the benefit of intermodal transport through the creation of an open system architecture that enables intermodal location and tracking; 

